			title: "Ship Graveyard"
			description: ["Enter the Aquamirae Ice Maze.", "", "Aquamirae roofs the Deep Frozen Ocean with ice and wrecked pirate", "ships. There is no air under the roof and the water freezes you.", "Do not come here before you have diving gear and a way back out."]
