			description: ["Craft a Remnant Saber.", "", "Maws and Eels drop Sharp Bones. Two bones, string and a stick make the", "Remnant Saber -- the free weapon the maze hands you before you have", "anything better. Eels also drop the Dead Sea Scroll."]
