			id: "0688499827BD5432"
			title: "Angler's Teeth"
			description: ["Collect Fins and Angler Fangs.", "", "Anglerfish drop both, plus an Esca. The light in the dark is the bait --", "it is on a fish. Fins and Fangs are the whole currency of the next tier,", "so farm more than you think you need."]
