			id: "68B04ED2E3ADD46D"
			title: "Terrible Upgrade"
			description: ["Smith a piece of Terrible armour.", "", "The template drops from Pirate and Treasure Pouches on the wrecks --", "break the pouch to open it. Duplicate the template with 4 Fangs and", "4 Fins. Smithing takes IRON armour plus a FIN, not the fang the tooltip", "claims. Half the set poisons attackers; the full set gives Dolphin's Grace."]
