			id: "A0B43C7501671762"
			title: "The Shipbreaker"
			description: ["Survive an encounter with the Shipbreaker.", "", "A leviathan that swims through the ice itself. You cannot kill it and", "you cannot outswim it -- get behind a wreck. The point of meeting it is", "what it does to everything else in the water."]
			dependencies: ["89C19FB5D29B1260"]
