			y: 0.0d
			id: "2D676437573F4AB4"
			title: "Echoes"
			description: ["Collect six Ship Graveyard Echoes.", "", "THE GOTCHA: an Echo only drops when the SHIPBREAKER lands the killing", "blow on an Anglerfish, Maw, Scuttler, Spinefish or Abyssal Scyphoid.", "Lead it across a shoal and let it feed. Kill them yourself and you get", "nothing -- this is the single thing that stalls people in Aquamirae."]
			dependencies: ["A0B43C7501671762"]
